  "home_memoria_voci_0_testo": "so you can return to the thread of a situation.",
  "home_memoria_voci_1_titolo": "Readings and outcomes",
  "home_memoria_voci_1_testo": "so reflection can include what happened next.",
  "home_memoria_voci_2_titolo": "Your choices",
