  "home_fisico_scheda_testo": "Choose a spread, name the cards you drew, add your question and continue with a guided interpretation.",
  "home_metodo_eyebrow": "Method, trust and privacy",
  "home_metodo_titolo": "What happens behind a reading.",
  "home_metodo_0_titolo": "The Thoth tradition",
  "home_metodo_0_testo": "Every card carries its real attributions — Hebrew letter, path, decan, sephira — and neighbouring cards modulate each other through elemental dignities.",
  "home_metodo_1_titolo": "One card at a time",
  "home_metodo_1_testo": "Cards are revealed in order. Each interpretation holds the cards already seen, then the whole spread is read together with your question and your words.",
  "home_metodo_2_titolo": "The role of the AI",
  "home_metodo_2_testo": "An AI connects symbols, positions and your words. It interprets; it does not know the future, and it tells you so.",
  "home_metodo_3_titolo": "Your data",
  "home_metodo_3_testo": "Readings and memory stay in your account. The other person's surname never reaches the AI, and you can delete what is remembered at any time.",
  "home_funnel_eyebrow": "Free first, deeper by choice",
  "home_funnel_titolo": "Value arrives before the invitation to register.",
  "home_funnel_intro": "Your first reading is free and needs no account: you take part in the whole ritual and see a first response. When you want the full interpretation, a free account keeps it and adds {n} more free readings.",
