  "home_diario_riserva_1_titolo": "Which spread helps a difficult decision?",
  "home_diario_riserva_2_etichetta": "Card of the day",
  "home_diario_riserva_2_titolo": "A small encounter, free every day",
  "home_faq_eyebrow": "A clear boundary",
  "home_faq_titolo": "Mystical does not have to mean misleading.",
  "home_faq_0_d": "Is this a prediction?",
  "home_faq_0_r": "No. Tarot can be a reflective language for questions, patterns and choices. It does not guarantee future events or scientific certainty.",
  "home_faq_1_d": "Is it free?",
  "home_faq_1_r": "Your first reading is free, without an account: you take part in the whole ritual and see a first response. A free account unlocks the full interpretation and adds free readings. After that, readings use packages or a subscription. The card of the day is always free.",
  "home_faq_2_d": "What does the reader remember?",
  "home_faq_2_r": "When you choose to create an account, it can retain your questions, readings and selected context to support follow-ups. You can review, edit or delete it.",
  "home_faq_3_d": "Do I need a TAROTS chat deck?",
