  "privacy_titolo": "Mystical does not have to mean opaque.",
  "privacy_intro": "What is kept, why, and how you decide. The same rules apply to every page of TAROTS chat.",
  "privacy_letture_titolo": "Your readings and your memory",
  "privacy_letture_testo": "Readings are kept in your account so you can return to them. What your reader remembers comes from your readings and conversations, and you can review, edit or delete it at any time from My story. Deleting a reading removes it for good.",
  "privacy_letture_cta": "Manage what is remembered",
  "privacy_letture_accesso": "For security reasons only (for example to handle a report of abuse or a request for help), the administrators of TAROTS chat can read your readings, conversations, what the reader remembers and your profile data. Each access requires a stated reason and is recorded in a log.",
  "privacy_ai_titolo": "How the AI is used",
