  "app_consensi_titolo": "Privacy and your data",
  "app_consensi_testo": "Technical data on this device keeps the app working and needs no consent. Everything else stays off until you turn it on: accept all, reject all, or choose one by one. You can change your mind at any time in your profile.",
  "app_consenso_statistiche": "App statistics",
  "app_consenso_statistiche_testo": "A random identifier recognises this device when you come back. It stays with us, never with third parties.",
  "app_consenso_google": "Google Analytics",
  "app_consenso_google_testo": "Google Analytics for Firebase (Google Ireland) measures how the app is used, with an identifier stored on the device; data may go to the United States.",
  "app_consenso_tecnici": "Technical data on the device (signing in, the free reading, these choices) is always kept: without it the app does not work.",
  "app_cons_statistiche_testo": "A random identifier recognises this device when you come back. Turning it off makes our servers forget it.",
  "app_cons_google_testo": "Google Analytics for Firebase measures how the app is used. Turning it off stops it at once.",
  "app_scelte_titolo": "Your choices on this device",
  "app_scelte_testo": "Everything below is off until you turn it on, and you can change it here at any time. Technical data on the device (signing in, the anonymous free reading, remembering these choices) needs no consent: without it the app does not work.",
