  "app_codice_testo": "If you already used TAROTS chat on the website with a different sign-in, the app may have created a new account. Create a code here and enter it in your profile on the website («Do you have a code from the app?») within 10 minutes: this sign-in moves to your account there, together with what you did in the app.",
